 PostgreSQL test configurations</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://code.review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2671?rev=6\">r6</a></td><td><details><summary>Removed empty endpoints from test cases</summary>Deleted redundant empty <code>Endpoints</code> slice initialization in multiple test scenarios within <code>TestTailNode</code></details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://code.review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2671?rev=5\">r5</a></td><td><details><summary>Artifact naming simplified in workflows</summary>Removed database type from artifact names in test integration workflows, simplifying artifact identification</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://code.review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2671?rev=4\">r4</a></td><td><details><summary>Simplified node conversion helper functions</summary>Removed conversion helpers for endpoints and online status, using direct view method calls in tailNode function</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://code.review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2671?rev=3\">r3</a></td><td><details><summary>Added Postgres-specific integration test workflow</summary>Created a new GitHub Actions workflow specifically for Postgres integration tests, with separate configuration from the existing integration test workflow</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://code.review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2671?rev=2\">r2</a></td><td><details><summary>Refactored node processing methods</summary>Optimized node processing by using <code>append()</code>, simplifying IP and hostname handling, and adding unique prefix deduplication</details></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"https://code.review.ai/pr/juanfont/headscale/2671?rev=1\">r1</a></td><td><details><summary>Migrated Headscale to immutable node views</summary>Implemented a comprehensive migration to use read-only views for nodes, adding view-based methods, generating view types with cloning support, and updating various components to work with immutable node representations.</details></td></tr></table><hr/>☑️ 